melody:
Lul-la-by and good night,
G4/ G4/ Bb4. G4/ G4 Bb4 r
With ro-ses be-dight,
G4/ ~Bb4/ Eb5 D5. C5/ C5 ~Bb4
With lil-ies o'er-spread
F4/ ~G4/ Ab4 F4 F4/ ~G4/ Ab4 r
Is ba-by's wee bed.
F4/ ~Ab4/ D5/ ~C5/ Bb4 D5 Eb5 r
Lay thee down now and rest,
Eb4/ Eb4/ Eb5(2) C5/ Ab4/ Bb4(2)
May thy slum-ber be blest.
G4/ Eb4/ Ab4 Bb4 C5 Bb4(2)
Lay thee down now and rest,
